WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.760
SCP-682 Vs SCP-513. Sometimes, to&nbsp;
take down a scary SCP like SCP-682,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:14.160
you need to bring in an even scarier SCP, like&nbsp;
this demonic cowbell and the phantom it reveals.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:20.080
SCP-682 was partially incinerated and brought&nbsp;
into a testing chamber, where a robot arm rang&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:27.360
the SCP-513 bell several times, with the resulting&nbsp;
sound causing extreme stress for SCP-682.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.640
Aerosolized tranquilizers and sedatives were&nbsp;
pumped into the chamber, causing 682 to fall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:36.960
unconscious. It then began sleepwalking,&nbsp;
breaching the containment chamber, but it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.800
wasn’t alone: A nightmarish, ghost-like entity,&nbsp;
resembling SCP-682, began stalking the halls.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.320
After mass hysteria and mass&nbsp;
staff death across the site,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:51.200
the Foundation finally got things back&nbsp;
under control. When SCP-682 was woken up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:54.800
it complained, saying that it&nbsp;
was having such a lovely dream...

